{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation in an RNA-only multiprofile setup using scvi_n200, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6530 and F1 of 0.6283, slightly higher than the avgpool baseline (0.6501 and 0.6275). The results suggest transformer aggregation may offer marginal improvement, but the small difference and lack of direct comparison to other aggregation methods leave uncertainty about its relative effectiveness in this configuration."
}

